      "content": "but isnt that just being extra cautious? its just a tiny bit of soap. i really dont have time to sit in an urgent care for hours. if i just rinse it really well with water and then put the drops in to prevent any infection, isnt that basically doing the same thing? i just want to know if the drops are safe to use if i rinse first.",
